a/griggs-county"],["ARC or PLC in Griggs County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/griggs-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Griggs County came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years for both October to November and November to December. In 2026 so far, March to April and April to May each sat at 76% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid in the table had its driest year in 1976, with grid 32828 and grid 32829 down to 56% that year.</p>"}
